    "body": "Advances roadmap #957 (authorization/privacy/IDOR audit).\n\nThis slice hardens private saved-search radius results so a missing or transient authenticated principal is rejected before any saved-search repository access. The service now derives a durable actor ID first and passes that verified ID into match filtering.\n\nRegression coverage proves both null and transient users fail closed with zero interactions against SavedSearchRepository and SavedSearchResultRepository, while existing owner-scoped radius behavior remains unchanged.",
